notes:
The token is the ONLY blocker. Both of the other printed lines are expressible today, and the card ships the moment the one-line token id lands. Crew is NOT a gap: `cost_keys` carries `tap_permanents`, docs/card-dsl.md line 1382 spells `{"tap_permanents": {"types": ["Creature"], "total_power": 3}}` as "crew 3" and its "Crew -- a tap cost measured in power" section gives the whole ability, and docs/rules-coverage.md lists Crew as implemented with the note that Vehicle needed nothing because `subtypes` is free text. The `nth: 2` draw trigger is equally proven: shipped `prince_imrahil_the_fair` writes "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token." as {"event": "draw", "controller": "you", "nth": 2} with a bare `create_token`, which is byte-for-byte the shape this card wants.

The rest of the card spells out as: id `thopter_fabricator`, name "Thopter Fabricator", mana_cost "{2}{U}", types ["Artifact"], subtypes ["Vehicle"], power 4, toughness 4, colors ["U"], color_identity ["U"], keywords ["flying"] (that is the whole first printed line -- a Vehicle may carry flying while it is not a creature). Two abilities:

1. {"kind": "triggered", "text": "Whenever you draw your second card each turn, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.", "trigger": {"event": "draw", "controller": "you", "nth": 2}, "effects": [{"op": "create_token", "token": "<the new thopter_1_1_c_flying id>"}]}

2. {"kind": "activated", "text": "Crew 2", "cost": {"tap_permanents": {"controller": "you", "types": ["Creature"], "total_power": 2}}, "effects": [{"op": "animate", "power": {"const": 4}, "toughness": {"const": 4}, "types": ["Creature"], "objects": {"zone": "battlefield", "self_only": true}}]}

Expectation would be {"zone": "battlefield", "battlefield_count": 33}: the card is a noncreature artifact that just resolves, nothing in the sandbox position draws a card after it lands so the `nth: 2` trigger never fires and no `tokens` assertion is available, and Crew is an activated ability the harness never activates.
